    description: "Extend _check_id_roundtrip (spec_validator.py) to enforce ADR-0036 Ruling-3's path/span sentinel enumeration, beyond the span start<=end check already shipped in PR #227: path '<external>' is the only legal non-file path sentinel; span '0-0' is the synthetic-no-location sentinel; span '1-1' is legal ONLY in the file pseudo-symbol triple (name='file', kind='file'). Anything outside the enumeration is a violation. Identity-neutral (validator-only). Land advisory first and run a schema-coverage-corpus + self-analysis scan before promoting to error — the memo flagged false-positive risk on uncatalogued conventions. Deferred follow-up of id-format:F3 (PR #227)."  # 0f65
